{
      "name": "BFS — 01 Ingestion",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "content": "## BFS — 01 Ingestion\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Manually trigger the workflow execution.\n2. Retrieve documents from Supabase without embeddings.\n3. Process each document in batches.\n4. Generate embeddings using an API request.\n5. Save embeddings back to Supabase.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Set up Supabase credentials for database access\n- [ ] Configure HTTP node with API key for OpenAI embeddings\n- [ ] Ensure the Supabase table structure supports embedding storage\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust batch sizes in the 'Loop Over Items' node.",
            "width": 480,
            "height": 576
          },
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
